              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "You can allow and disallow many other users to send as you in a single command by supplying the user IDs you want to allow and disallow.\n\nOnce completed, this endpoint returns all existing associations where your user is the allowing user."
